  "body": "As far as I'm considered the links to the translated versions (Chinese and Japanese) of the Standard are no longer available as they were on October 17 (latest capture available on [WebArchive](https://web.archive.org/web/20191017133744/https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/Translations)). \r\nI see no more on the regarding page as the Portuguese word for 'introduction'. The gitHub pages of the translations do still exist. Am I missing something ([Chinese](https://whatwg-cn.github.io/html/) and Japanese [[1](https://momdo.github.io/html/), [2](https://triple-underscore.github.io/index.html#spec-list-html)] translation)?  Have a look yourself: https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/Translations",
